WEBVTT

00:03:28.911 --> 00:03:32.895
(Laughter)

00:03:32.919 --> 00:03:35.078
But their answers are fascinating,

00:03:35.102 --> 00:03:37.537
because they say things like,

00:03:37.561 --> 00:03:39.537
"when my sports team loses,"

00:03:39.561 --> 00:03:41.958
"people who chew too loudly."

00:03:41.982 --> 00:03:44.410
That is surprisingly common, by the way.

00:03:44.434 --> 00:03:47.514
"People who walk too slowly,"
that one's mine.

00:03:47.974 --> 00:03:49.949
And of course, "roundabouts."

00:03:49.973 --> 00:03:51.149
Roundabouts --

00:03:51.173 --> 00:03:53.164
(Laughter)

00:03:53.188 --> 00:03:56.299
I can tell you honestly,
there is no rage like roundabout rage.

00:03:56.323 --> 00:03:58.712
(Laughter)

00:03:59.219 --> 00:04:01.300
Sometimes their answers
aren't minor at all.